### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Register an employee
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Counselor",
  "email": "alice@crm.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@crm.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Submit a public enquiry (no auth required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/public
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "courseInterest": "Computer Science",
  "message": "Interested in CS program"
}

### 4. Get unclaimed leads (auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/unclaimed?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer <insert-jwt-token-here>

### 5. Claim a lead (auth required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/<LEAD_ID>/claim
Authorization: Bearer <insert-jwt-token-here>

### 6. Get my claimed leads (auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads/my?page=1&limit=10&search=John
Authorization: Bearer <insert-jwt-token-here>

### 7. Release a claimed lead (auth required, owner only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/<LEAD_ID>/release
Authorization: Bearer <insert-jwt-token-here>

### 8. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
